--- !u!114 &1960590347
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1960590345}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: I see you got my call...
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Yeah... About that...
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "It\u2019s true! Storm is trying to kill Spartan Jack! I don\u2019t know
      what got into her!"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Kill.. him?? Storm?!?!?! Am I understanding this right?

'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I bet it has something to do with\u2026 E-S-Pow. I don\u2019t know quite
      what yet. Do you know about E-S-Pow?\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Does it have to do with ESP?

'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Bingo. Just with a bit more\u2026 \u201CPow\u201D\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: " It\u2019s how I got you up at midnight. It was quite the challenge. All
      that snoring made it hard to focus\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "Psychic powers\u2026 are REAL?!\r\n"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "You don\u2019t believe me, do you?\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "Let me prove it to you... \nI'll get inside your MIND real quick..."
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You\u2019re thinking of your stomach right now. You\u2019re thinking \u201CMan,
      if the Party Bus only had sandwiches\u201D\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: "Gee, THANKS\u2026 Now you got me thinking of FOOD\u2026 And my fridge
      is so far away. I hate you\u2026\r\n"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Isn\u2019t E-S-Pow great?\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Alright.

      We''re here.

'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Where... Exactly... Is here?

'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1915123191}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Storm''s top secret base obviously.

      Oh wait - you wouldn''t know
      that. It''s a secret.

      Be prepared for anything'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1960590346}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
